  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Tropical Timber Organization (ITTO): Voluntary Project Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary co-contribution of AU$60,000 to the &#x2018;Conservation and sustainable use of biodiversity in tropical production forests&#x2019; project in ITTO&apos;s Biennial Work Programme. Project is supporting ITTO&#x2019;s engagement with the CBD to advance forest-related biodiversity goals under the Kunming&#x2013;Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework through collaboration, knowledge-sharing, and capacity-building.</narrative>
  </description>
